  m_text: "<size=24>- 3 or more Scatters triggers a Picker Bonus to determine the
    \n   number of Free Games. \n- More Scatters allows for more emerald stones to
    be picked. \n   Emeralds award number of Free Games and additional picks.\n- In
    Free Games, Wild Bubbles appear more frequently."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a3571e62f0b024a9c8af5c3f45721b63, type: 2}
